  "body": "### Summary\n\nProposed by Bybifok (GitHub moust4ki, 2026-10-26): Home / \"À suivre\" — resume last reading, unread MPs, super favourites, favourites, flags with news grouped by category, Alertes Qualitaÿ; first sidebar entry on iPad. Replaces the Favoris tab (\"Tout\" opens the current favourites screen)\n\n### Scope\n\n**Home / \"À suivre\"**: resume last reading, unread MPs, super favourites, favourites, flags with news grouped by category, Alertes Qualitaÿ; first sidebar entry on iPad. Replaces the Favoris tab (\"Tout\" opens the current favourites screen)\n\n- Phase: 4 · Priority: high · Status: proposed · Owner: —\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-023 (#51), LOT-024 (#52), LOT-055 (#81), LOT-064 (#89)\n\nNew engine work needed (no lot yet): reading-position store (HFRStorage)\n\nEngine dependencies as written: 023, 024, 055, 064, **new** reading-position store (HFRStorage)\n\n### Open questions\n\nMigration of the legacy \"start screen\" and \"favourites mode\" settings (LOT-060 (#85)/067)\n\n### Spec\n\n`docs/features/FEAT-001.md` does not exist yet; create it when moving idea → spec (ADR 0011 §2).\n\n### Source\n\n[docs/FEATURES.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/FEATURES.md), [research/bybifok-proposals.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/research/bybifok-proposals.md); proposal credit stays with Bybifok (CREDITS.md).\n",
