   "body": "Operator decision 2026-10-28 (navigation): preserve what works. The legacy bottom bar \"Catégories / Favoris / Messages / Plus\" stays (LOT-170 (#296)); **Drapeaux / Favoris do not go on top of the home page**, and the Home \"À suivre\" does **not** replace the Favoris tab by default. This feature may come later as a community proposal *if the community supports it*: until then it stays `proposed`, and if it is built it is opt-in only (start-screen choice), never the default and never above the Catégories list.\n\nAcceptance criteria added here (FEAT-001, LOT-143 (#233), LOT-144 (#234)):\n- [ ] Community support recorded on this issue (link to the forum discussion) before LOT-143 is claimed.\n- [ ] Default navigation unchanged: the app still opens on the legacy tabs, Favoris tab unchanged; Home is reachable only when the user chooses it.\n- [ ] On iPad, Home is not inserted above Catégories in the sidebar by default.\n",
